                 the Blox Dinner Licence (BDL)                

                        Aug. 6th, 2026                        

The BDL is an open-source licence.
You can copy this licence, but you can’t change the text.
The original file is in <github.com/hsdgekwjrf/Blox-Dinner-Lic
ence>.

If you want to use the BDL, you need to follow the rules here:

1.Keep the Code Open

If you are a Dev, you need to upload your code to some PUBLIC 
internet website, like github, pastebin.
When someone else ask you for the code, you need to give them 
the code.

2.the Using of the Code

If someone want to use your code, their code need to be open--
source and follow the BDL or the GPL licence.
If you give them permission, they can let their code be closed
but you can't ask them open their code again.

3.Open-source to being Closed

If you want to make it be closed, you need to keep the OLD co-
de OPEN, but you also can be closed your new code.
If you copied someone's BDL open-source code, you can't let y-
our code be closed.

4.the Copy

If someone copied your code, they need to make a notice to te-
ll that they used YOUR code and put a link on it.(If it has)

5.Protect your code

If you want to let BDL protect your code better, you can add  
the text here to your code:
"This Program used the Blox Dinner Licence, protected by the  
BDL. You need to read <github.com/hsdgekwjrf/Blox-Dinner-Licen
ce> that if you want to use the code."